  "notes": "Blackbeard’s Castle, the Skytsborg watchtower on Government Hill, in its early twentieth-century appearance around the 1918 postcard. Includes the tapered rubble-masonry tower, north entry and historical wooden observatory on the parapet. The National Park Service supplies the measured tower diameter, height and north arch. The mapped outline gives the location but is wider than the measured wall."
